    "note": "`content_filename` is `<role>.<sha256[:12]><suffix>`, the suffix `Path.suffix` of the original name as typed, else the role's default (`.mov`, or `.jpg` for the shot screen). `clip.` and `.hidden` have no suffix to `Path` (Rust's `Path::extension` reads `clip.` as an empty extension and would write a bare dot), and `photo.tar.gz` keeps only `.gz`",
